youtu.be/gsx_UDkVPd0?t=613"]},{"field":"late_games_out","text":"A weak team without its own pick is the type that can protect a fragile star late in the season. That is moderate risk, not certain.","sources":["https://youtu.be/uRsfijpBPok?t=1851"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}